{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":24.8700008392334,"text":"A bronze dagger from the graves at Mycenae. Its blade decorated in a technique closer to painting on metal. Tiny pieces of gold, silver, and a black alloy inlaid into the bronze. The scene shows hunters with shields facing lions. The figures are a few millimeters tall, and you can still make out legs, manes, and shields. There really were lions in Greece back then.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.4399999976158142},{"word":"bronze","start":0.4399999976158142,"end":0.7599999904632568},{"word":"dagger","start":0.7599999904632568,"end":1.1200000047683716},{"word":"from","start":1.1200000047683716,"end":1.4600000381469727},{"word":"the","start":1.4600000381469727,"end":1.9199999570846558},{"word":"graves","start":1.9199999570846558,"end":1.9199999570846558},{"word":"at","start":1.9199999570846558,"end":2.4600000381469727},{"word":"Mycenae","start":2.4600000381469727,"end":2.7200000286102295},{"word":"Its","start":3.259999990463257,"end":3.440000057220459},{"word":"blade","start":3.440000057220459,"end":3.759999990463257},{"word":"decorated","start":3.759999990463257,"end":4.300000190734863},{"word":"in","start":4.300000190734863,"end":4.619999885559082},{"word":"a","start":4.619999885559082,"end":5.179999828338623},{"word":"technique","start":5.179999828338623,"end":5.179999828338623},{"word":"closer","start":5.179999828338623,"end":5.639999866485596},{"word":"to","start":5.639999866485596,"end":6.039999961853027},{"word":"painting","start":6.039999961853027,"end":6.320000171661377},{"word":"on","start":6.320000171661377,"end":6.840000152587891},{"word":"metal","start":6.840000152587891,"end":6.840000152587891},{"word":"Tiny","start":7.619999885559082,"end":7.659999847412109},{"word":"pieces","start":7.659999847412109,"end":8.039999961853027},{"word":"of","start":8.039999961853027,"end":8.800000190734863},{"word":"gold","start":8.800000190734863,"end":8.800000190734863},{"word":"silver"